{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06552","headline":"酬綦毋校书梦耶溪见赠之作 · 储光羲","name":"酬綦毋校书梦耶溪见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"校文在仙掖，每有沧洲心。\n况以北窗下，梦游清溪阴。\n春看湖水漫，夜入回塘深。\n往往缆垂葛，出舟望前林。\n山人松下饭，钓客芦中吟。\n小隐何足贵，长年固可寻。\n还车首东道，惠言若黄金。\n以我采薇意，传之天姥岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}